Copyright 2026 Drew Bednar. Licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0.

An ONNX conversion of androiddrew/naptrap-phonmatchnet-en (revision v1, commit
e8f6c45bff04d7368cbe14979392b7d52dc88ba8), made by Drew Bednar for
go-phonmatchnet. The trained values are unchanged; the computation, including
the log-mel frontend, was re-expressed as ONNX operators.

The weights were trained independently by Drew Bednar using the
BSD-3-Clause-licensed PhonMatchNet PyTorch training code published by NCSOFT
(https://github.com/ncsoft/PhonMatchNet, "pytorch" branch), with
modifications. NCSOFT's copyright notice and license are reproduced in
licenses/PhonMatchNet-BSD-3-Clause.txt.

Not affiliated with or endorsed by NCSOFT Corporation or the PhonMatchNet
authors (Yong-Hyeok Lee, Namhyun Cho).

Training data: LibriSpeech ASR corpus (train-clean-100, train-clean-360),
V. Panayotov, G. Chen, D. Povey, S. Khudanpur, licensed CC BY 4.0,
https://www.openslr.org/12

Companion models used as frozen inputs, distributed separately:
- Google speech_embedding/1 (Apache-2.0):
  https://huggingface.co/androiddrew/google-speech-embedding-onnx
- g2p_en 2.1.0 decoder by Kyubyong Park and Jongseok Kim (Apache-2.0):
  https://huggingface.co/androiddrew/g2p-en-decoder-onnx
